### Feature Encounter — CREATE
### Leyenda: JWT + RBAC (login como admin + Authorization: Bearer)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

# @name createEncounter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/encounters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointment_id": 1,
  "service_id": 1,
  "total": 85000,
  "state": "completed",
  "observations": "Paciente estable, se dan recomendaciones generales",
  "status": "active"
}
